1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Observe example 1

2
00:00:07,710 --> 00:00:17,550
First set up division like dividing by a one-digit number

3
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:29,930
Perform division from left to right

4
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:46,620
Take 70 divided by 47 equals 1, write 1 in quotient

5
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:55,130
1 times 7 equals 7, write 7 (under 0)

6
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:03,480
1 times 4 equals 4, write 4 (under 7)

7
00:01:03,480 --> 00:01:11,370
Take 70 minus 47 equals 23

8
00:01:11,370 --> 00:01:20,420
Remainder 23 is less than 47, the divisor

9
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:32,020
Bring down 5 (after 23) to get 235

10
00:01:32,020 --> 00:01:40,660
Perform second division round, three steps

11
00:01:40,660 --> 00:01:52,840
Divide 235 by 47, equals 5; write 5 (write quotient after 1)

12
00:01:52,840 --> 00:02:02,370
Multiply: 5 times 7 equals 35, write 5 carry 3

13
00:02:02,370 --> 00:02:17,950
5 times 4 equals 20, plus 3 equals 23, write 23

14
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:27,060
Subtract: 235 minus 235 equals 0, write 0

15
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:39,600
In division we perform 2 division rounds, dividing left to right in turn

16
00:02:40,660 --> 00:02:43,550
Example 2

17
00:02:45,550 --> 00:02:54,020
Set up then calculate 779 divided by 18

18
00:02:54,020 --> 00:03:02,660
Set up like example 1

19
00:03:04,350 --> 00:03:21,020
First division round take 77 divided by 18 equals 4, write 4 at quotient

20
00:03:21,020 --> 00:03:36,730
4 times 8 equals 32, write 2 under 7, carry 3

21
00:03:36,730 --> 00:03:49,040
4 times 1 equals 4 plus 3 equals 7, write 7 under 7

22
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:57,770
77 minus 72 equals 5, write 5

23
00:03:57,770 --> 00:04:04,400
Bring down 9 to get 59

24
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:09,570
Perform second division round

25
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:18,860
59 divided by 18, equals 3, write 3 (at quotient after 4)

26
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:30,800
3 times 8 equals 24, write 4 (under 9), carry 2

27
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:41,600
3 times 1 equals 3 plus 2 equals 5, write 5 (under 5)

28
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:48,680
59 minus 54 equals 5, write 5

29
00:04:48,680 --> 00:05:01,060
Note: Division 779 divided by 18 is division with remainder, remainder equals 5

30
00:05:01,060 --> 00:05:10,310
Each division round remainder is always less than divisor

